## What Has Been Implemented

### 1. `robots.txt` — Crawl Directives

**File:** `frontend/public/robots.txt`

Tells search engine bots which pages to crawl and which to skip.

```
Allow:    /explore, /events/, /communities/, /categories/, /about
Disallow: /login, /signup, /admin/, /billing/, /payment/, /user/dashboard, etc.
Sitemap:  https://www.indulgeout.com/sitemap.xml
```

**Why it matters:** Prevents Google from wasting crawl budget on auth/dashboard pages that should never appear in search results. Only public discovery pages are indexed.

---

### 2. Dynamic XML Sitemap

**File:** `backend/routes/sitemap.js`  
**URL:** `https://www.indulgeout.com/sitemap.xml`

A backend endpoint that auto-generates an up-to-date sitemap every time Google fetches it. The sitemap is cached for 1 hour to avoid unnecessary database load.

**What's included:**

| Page Type | Priority | Update Frequency |
|-----------|----------|-----------------|
| Homepage (`/`) | 1.0 | Daily |
| Explore page (`/explore`) | 0.9 | Daily |
| Communities tab | 0.8 | Daily |
| Categories page | 0.8 | Weekly |
| About page | 0.5 | Monthly |
| Individual event pages (`/events/:slug`) | 0.8 | Weekly |
| Individual community pages (`/communities/:id`) | 0.7 | Weekly |

**Why it matters:** Without a sitemap, Google discovers pages slowly by following links. With a sitemap submitted to Google Search Console, all published event and community pages can be discovered within days.

---

### 3. SEOHead Component — Meta Tags on Every Page

**File:** `frontend/src/components/SEOHead.jsx`

A reusable React component (using `react-helmet-async`) that injects the correct meta tags into the `<head>` for each page. Handles:

- Page `<title>` (formatted as `Page Name | IndulgeOut`)
- Meta `description`
- **Open Graph tags** (controls how links look when shared on WhatsApp, Facebook, LinkedIn, Telegram)
- **Twitter Card tags** (controls how links look on Twitter/X)
- **Canonical URL** (prevents duplicate content penalties)
- **JSON-LD structured data** (for rich results in Google)

**Pages covered:**

| Page | Title | Description |
|------|-------|-------------|
| Homepage | Offline Experiences Made Easy | Full brand tagline |
| Explore | Explore Events & Experiences | Keyword-rich discovery description |
| Categories | Browse Event Categories | Lists activity types |
| Category Detail | `{Category Name}` Events | Dynamic per-category |
| Community Detail | `{Community Name}` | Dynamic — uses community's own description |
| Event Detail | `{Event Title}` | Dynamic — uses event's own description |
| About | About Us | Mission statement |

