## What to Expect — Timeline

### Weeks 1–2 (after sitemap submission)
- Google Search Console will show all event and community pages being discovered and indexed
- Link previews on WhatsApp, Instagram DMs, Telegram, and LinkedIn will now show the event image, title, and description — no more blank cards

### Weeks 3–6
- Pages start appearing in Google search results for their event/community names
- Event rich results (date + venue cards) may begin appearing in Google Search for branded searches

### Month 2–3
- Organic traffic from "events in [city]" and "things to do in [city]" style queries begins to build
- Community pages may start ranking for community names

### Month 4–6
- Long-tail event queries start converting ("salsa workshop Mumbai", "rooftop party Delhi")
- With consistent publishing of events, IndulgeOut's domain authority grows

> **Note:** SEO is cumulative. The more events published, the more indexed pages, the stronger the domain signal. One event published per week is far better for SEO than 10 at once.
